@* Functional resident notification bell.

   Lives to the left of the profile badge in each resident page header. The
   button is a Bootstrap dropdown toggle; site.js fills the panel from
   /Resident/GetNotifications, keeps the red unread badge in sync and posts to
   /Resident/MarkAsRead when an item (or "Mark all as read") is clicked.

   data-endpoint-prefix tells the shared script which controller to call, so
   the same markup can be reused by every resident page without hard-coding
   URLs. *@
<div class="notification-wrapper position-relative">
    <button class="notification-button" type="button"
            data-bs-toggle="dropdown" data-bs-auto-close="outside"
            aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Notifications">
        <i class="bi bi-bell"></i>
        <span class="notif-badge" style="display:none">0</span>
    </button>
    <div id="notifDropdown" class="notif-dropdown dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end shadow-lg p-0"
         data-endpoint-prefix="/Resident"></div>
</div>
